{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年63歲的「大美人」關之琳年輕時靚絕影圈，更有「香江第一美人」之稱，即使她已淡出幕前多年，但風采依然，凍齡美貌更令人稱羨。日前關之琳在社交平台上載了一段搭天星小輪的短片，片中的她身穿淺藍色裇衫襯牛仔褲，造型簡約又不失氣質，她在船上一邊欣賞維港靚景，一邊大擺Pose影相，網民紛紛留言大讚靚人靚景！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250912/1043227977191526400187640.jpeg/5Q0_fGRNFd6PmHjr4eiXBcbHYODee5HrngiDxZ4Ig8U\" alt=\"靚！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>靚！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240806/897511083634331648761983.jpeg/NH02OF3r-8bFShj6k-NcieT8ETNgUOJeO3duvzt3br8\" alt=\"關之琳是大美人。（微博@關之琳）\"><figcaption>關之琳是大美人。（微博@關之琳）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231111/800123078376951808740539.jpeg/gqmNH5aVqQcntHLWhWYcH0U6C6PsS5YFrpy-hK6cvoQ\" alt=\"關之琳有「香江第一美人」之稱。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>關之琳有「香江第一美人」之稱。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260426/1125190443353509888092316.jpeg/pX_Pfunqpc3BJpCmXWidNnk2sYMwzkY8UiGpimghqYo\" alt=\"關之琳早前現身草蜢演唱會，食定喉糖，可能預了唱足一晚。（陳順禎 攝）\"><figcaption>關之琳早前現身草蜢演唱會，食定喉糖，可能預了唱足一晚。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131655481082253312504691.jpeg/gqICPia5BWpZUEEQ6uRaw0w-ZS6CNqijNvNSgTbzUoE\" alt=\"關之琳身穿淺藍色裇衫襯牛仔褲，造型簡約又不失氣質。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>關之琳身穿淺藍色裇衫襯牛仔褲，造型簡約又不失氣質。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131655476363399168285916.jpeg/vVkBU7NGfR3H6wubWx9BZhN2soDAvYoKEZnnYhGZ52I\" alt=\"搭天星小輪。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>搭天星小輪。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131655474148675584754630.jpeg/YmpTUNK8q_1N93Al9SqoPHJPEBhEZRBEpBXst6QV7Lc\" alt=\"搭天星小輪。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>搭天星小輪。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131655471673905152147293.jpeg/zS_-2P1p4kmnvlmTGgkAAVJO35Olkv3Jj491QI-PdUA\" alt=\"靚人靚景！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>靚人靚景！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>關之琳養尊處優住1.5億半山豪宅　生活無憂頻現身高端社交圈</p><p>近年關之琳養尊處優，家住價值1.5億的半山豪宅，不時拍片分享富貴生活，又相約好友聚會，生活無憂。去年關之琳迎來63歲生日，溥儀眼鏡創辦人邱子傑（Jeffery）與太太邱李茂琪（Margaret）齊齊為她慶生，身穿金黃色新中式服裝的關之琳，衫上繡有龍及五色彩雲等，十足十龍袍，一身打扮十分隆重！關之琳還戴上長串翡翠，相當雍容華貴，氣質出眾，雖然已年過60，但狀態極佳！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131655355290357760142583.jpeg/8iDfj9Xwd7g2PYyRvVchVMzTB8cZkUjiefX5Ann1-QI\" alt=\"關之琳家住價值1.5億的半山豪宅。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>關之琳家住價值1.5億的半山豪宅。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250202/962797673210187776760894.png/G6lPEcIVa3t_NnBSFuz3EwRASEZWf0NfqE2vRahNr0U\" alt=\"不時相約好友聚會。（小紅書圖片）\"><figcaption>不時相約好友聚會。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241023/925804939681599488942870.jpeg/ex3P5NvokGxED_gtN4j05j_zQdL3jyEoZC3jKGQt4yg\" alt=\"關之琳為好友溥儀眼鏡老闆娘邱李茂琪慶生。（IG@dr_maret_lee）\"><figcaption>關之琳為好友溥儀眼鏡老闆娘邱李茂琪慶生。（IG@dr_maret_lee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241107/931252332136763392873946.jpeg/ZQF2CSJQX3EGjLz3S8I-gGi1-_Ucxa-gEp96DRKfeg0\" alt=\"生日。（IG@janelouey）\"><figcaption>生日。（IG@janelouey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241107/931252334649282560036185.jpeg/yck5mVU4TvIA2BJsvWp2YBz2gFpIyxqGDAwZOAwMGTg\" alt=\"生日。（IG@janelouey）\"><figcaption>生日。（IG@janelouey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250924/1047570718734159872483750.jpeg/D5eiQBfqmGOqNRN1hMVQLns7NZDvZ8eCY6bKtWOmyrU\" alt=\"雍容華貴！（IG@jefferyyau）\"><figcaption>雍容華貴！（IG@jefferyyau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250924/1047570731497689088847315.jpeg/iwcaaDeydDwEY5O-TiPN-yk4rwj_bz7xPeLFvT3ixb0\" alt=\"63歲生日。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>63歲生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250924/1047570726061608960406138.jpeg/gcDZGpyecPANneMGjzXGK7FOQ2uYcC-URG6ZtkRumbY\" alt=\"63歲生日。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>63歲生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250912/1043225561356570624781349.jpeg/_BmSshw7aeIyOsbnFRuIfwN_n0SQxD_Hh1Ms9YdTLPU\" alt=\"氣質依然。（IG@dr_maret_lee）\"><figcaption>氣質依然。（IG@dr_maret_lee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250912/1043225558814691328659173.jpeg/mx42DQjgZ8WVknS4Mypi-taNWHi5OWYhEuv-xxLr_sc\" alt=\"為顧老闆慶生。（IG@dr_maret_lee）\"><figcaption>為顧老闆慶生。（IG@dr_maret_lee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250912/1043225556306366464023465.jpeg/1U_2IEVqxZv4NVUtKKNNwXlPHsH8dPFAgTCURIEwlEQ\" alt=\"聚會！（IG@dr_maret_lee）\"><figcaption>聚會！（IG@dr_maret_lee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250912/1043224977278636032982506.png/50sBKHx41KoFVDUjjuXb69QGwYQEKt5Eh0A-24dAPts\" alt=\"有網民在韓國偶遇關之琳。（小紅書圖片）\"><figcaption>有網民在韓國偶遇關之琳。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T08:32:11.209226+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":767,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}